        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "休露絲",
          "text": "而且我不知道你在那間屋子裡和恩希歐迪斯說了什麼。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "休露絲",
          "text": "但我可不想看著布朗陶家就這麼被你交到恩希歐迪斯手上！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "休露絲",
          "text": "瞪我幹嘛，想吵架嗎？",
